    "goal": "Execute this exact ordered read-only flow without skipping an already-selected control: click Main Menu; click Member Inquiry; select the search-mode combobox using literal DOM option value number even if number is already selected; fill the query input from {{member_number}}; click Search; use the semantic row-scoped Select control bound to {{member_number}}; extract exact scalar outputs member_number, member_name, email, phone, address from their semantic label-value targets; extract the complete Share ID, Type, Balance, Status semantic table into exact output shares with outputType table. Finish only after all six outputs are extracted and MEMBER RECORD is visible.",
